  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "咿——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "小心！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "我没事，只是擦伤而已，不要紧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "还不够......再这样下去，包围圈会越来越小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "我们已经找到了可突破口，但没有增援，我们只能采取守势，没法突围！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......请再坚持一下！优先用火力压制敌方射手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "敌人的先锋，就由我们术师来处理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "没错，没错！就该这样！接下来，f3，e5！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "可憎的小子......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "很好！那么，b4，b5！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "敌人正在向我们侧后方迂回！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "调两位重装干员和一位狙击干员！只要能牵制他们就足够了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "之后！h2，h6！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "他们，他们在冲击我们的阵线！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "近卫干员，把敌人赶出掩体！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "没错，再让我多看一会儿，你们挣扎的样子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "现在，术师，c7，吃掉敌人的战车吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "敌人的术师现身了......！之前，一直躲在重装干员身后吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "来不及了！趴下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "呜啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "然后就去死吧，就像雨夜中的火星一样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "他，是在指挥自己的队伍吗......！仅仅运用象棋走法，就能下达精准的命令？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "明明都是些狂暴的感染者，战斗却完全由他一人指挥......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "再这样下去，他会把指挥优势发挥到极致——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "相应的，只要能压制他的话，也就没什么大不了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "不要让整合运动打开哪怕一丁点缺口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "混账，我们的时间越来越少了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不能再让整合运动拖延我们的脚步了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "有什么，有什么办法能迅速打开局面吗......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "如果继续拖下去，博士和大家就......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔唔唔唔唔啊啊啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "......唔唔......怎么回事？怎么有人被......撞飞起来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "......什么啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "你们的速度比我估算的慢上太多了，我可是连平民都顺手安顿好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——？！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "别挡道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "呜啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "加大进攻力度！别给敌人重整阵形的机会！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "临光小姐！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "你没事就好，阿米娅。快撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "幸亏这次作战，有你参加。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "信号弹的定位很有效。看来你们遇到的麻烦确实不小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "您就是{@nickname}博士吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "耀骑士临光，前来迎接你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
